<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12562] FreeListCachingTest.testPageListCacheLimit failing in Disk Page Compressions suite</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12562</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test failing with IgniteOutOfMemory exception because Disk Page Compressions changes default page size to 8192, we need at least 2*1024 (2 caches, 1024 partitions) pages to store freelist metadata and there is no such amount of not dirty pages after checkpoint is triggered by &quot;too many dirty page&quot; reason.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Explicitly defined data region max size should take into account page size to avoid such errors.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
